{"unit_id":"eri64__dsh-claude-ux#card-zh","repo":"eri64/dsh-claude-ux","commit":"23f565aee7ffb55924ee6e36e30259f06a67877c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-claude-ux**（DSH 插件，web 客户端）：为 DSH Web profile 提供区域信号判定、交互管理与会话结束体验。它在 DSH 主机侧接入消息预处理、模型流和系统提示词，并由浏览器客户端提供独立设置页及结束态界面。主要功能包括依据本机与浏览器信号评估区域、配置目标区域和处理策略、对辱骂与有害内容分类并按阈值警告或结束对话，以及展示会话结束状态。适合需要在 DSH Web profile 管理区域策略和对话交互的部署者。默认总开关关闭；公网 IP 查询和 WebRTC 检测可选启用，无需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:817-1018","lib/client.js:334-500","cordis.patch.yml:13-30"]}
{"unit_id":"eri64__dsh-claude-ux#card-en","repo":"eri64/dsh-claude-ux","commit":"23f565aee7ffb55924ee6e36e30259f06a67877c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-claude-ux** is a DSH web plugin for region checks and interaction handling. It evaluates host and browser signals, classifies messages, and can warn or end chats. A settings page controls options; the client shows ended sessions. The master switch is off by default, and IP checks are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:817-1018","lib/client.js:334-500","cordis.patch.yml:13-30"]}
